        "created_at": "2020-12-15T06:56:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Minion Maker -- can the character hypothetically just keep creating Minions, or is there a limit on the number?&nbsp; Understandably there are other things to do and scenes don't last forever, but...&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Sidekicks -- there's a line in Minion Maker that says \"You may be able to have more permanent helpers based on story development; see pages 142-143 for details\", but if there's anything about it on those two pages, I'm not seeing it.&nbsp;&nbsp; Maybe the Sidekick rule on 248?&nbsp;&nbsp; Says you spend Hero Points on a Sidekick that's represented as a Minion... would be fun if there were a way to go a step further and have one built on the Lieutentant rules.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:32.324Z",
